@startuml
title RBAC — Authorization Hook Indirection
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

[Wrapper module\ne.g. ERC20MintModule] as W
[CMTATBaseAccessControl] as B
[OpenZeppelin\nAccessControl] as OZ

W --> B : declares\nvirtual _authorizeMint()
B --> OZ : overrides _authorizeMint()\nonlyRole(MINTER_ROLE)

note bottom of B
  The base overrides every virtual _authorizeX() with onlyRole(<ROLE>).
  Swapping the access-control mechanism means changing only the base,
  not the feature modules. DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE holds all roles
  (hasRole override).
end note
@enduml
